<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Runaway - 2006 Remaster</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Red Hot Chili Peppers</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">By the Way (Deluxe Edition)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4QzublfsJid9WfyzcHSU98</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.070" end="00:18.770">Walking around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.770" end="00:22.480">All over town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.480" end="00:25.030">Workin' it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.030" end="00:29.630">When you want to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.630" end="00:33.580">Soldiering my style and smiling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.580" end="00:36.960">Turn it into whatever I choose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.960" end="00:44.520">Take me now to the water</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.520" end="00:52.370">Don't be late I hear it's gonna be so very great and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.370" end="00:59.420">Out the door I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.420" end="01:06.570">All the reasons that I count of you can't haul away and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.570" end="01:14.570">More and more I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.570" end="01:22.570" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.000" end="01:31.370">Kick it around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.370" end="01:35.230">Stare at the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.230" end="01:37.960">Breakin' it down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.960" end="01:42.660">When you want to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.660" end="01:46.510">Soldiering my desert shows on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.510" end="01:49.890">Dance around, do whatever I want to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.890" end="01:57.330">Take me now it's the water</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.330" end="02:05.020">Don't be late I hear it's gonna be so very great and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.020" end="02:12.170">Out the door I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.170" end="02:19.420">All the reasons that I count of you can't haul away and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.420" end="02:27.420">More and more I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.430" end="02:35.430">I think I know everything your gonna say *eyyoooohhh*</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.340" end="02:49.340">I think you know why I wanna runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.340" end="02:57.340" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.030" end="03:31.690">Don't be late I hear it's gonna be so very great and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.690" end="03:38.890">Out the door I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:38.890" end="03:45.690">All the reasons that I count of you can't haul away and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.690" end="03:52.460">More and more I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:52.460" end="03:59.860">All the reasons that I count of you can't haul away and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:59.860" end="04:06.830">More and more I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:06.830" end="04:14.240">More and more I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:14.240" end="04:19.240">Out the door I'm walkin' like a runaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:19.240" end="04:23.240" /></div></body></tt>